flowchart TB
    SOURCES["1. Identify the sources"]
    BOUNDARIES["2. Define ownership<br/>and limits"]
    STRUCTURE["3. Structure checked<br/>content"]
    SLICE["4. Build a small<br/>reviewable slice"]
    INTEGRATE["5. Strengthen external<br/>integrations"]
    VERIFY["6. Verify each result<br/>with the right method"]
    PUBLIC["7. Prepare a separate<br/>public edition"]

    AGENT["Agent assistance<br/>Extract · research · draft · refactor · test"]
    HUMAN["Human decisions<br/>Source authority · client facts · privacy · release"]
    CHECKS["Observable checks<br/>Visual review · tests · browser · build · dated records"]

    SOURCES --> BOUNDARIES --> STRUCTURE --> SLICE --> INTEGRATE --> VERIFY --> PUBLIC
    VERIFY -.->|Unresolved or unsupported| BOUNDARIES

    AGENT -.-> STRUCTURE
    AGENT -.-> INTEGRATE
    HUMAN -.-> BOUNDARIES
    HUMAN -.-> PUBLIC
    CHECKS -.-> VERIFY

